{
  "chapter": 10,
  "title": "Zhou Shen Intro",
  "scriptId": "ch1001",
  "endReturnScreen": "selector",
  "entries": [
    {
      "speaker": "Miku",
      "text": "Wait... that voice...",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "assets/vn/backgrounds/deadline/zhoushen_story.png",
      "voice": "",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false,
      "bgm": "assets/combat/bgm/zhouShenStory.wav",
      "bgmVolume": 0.3
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Zhou Shen",
      "text": "You recognized me before you saw me. That is a singer's power too.",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Miku",
      "text": "You're Zhou Shen. Like... the Zhou Shen. Why am I fighting someone legendary this close to the finals?!",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "CupcakKe",
      "text": "Because this game hates peace.",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Miku",
      "text": "I'm serious! How am I supposed to stand in front of someone like him without feeling microscopic?!",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Zhou Shen",
      "text": "By standing there anyway.",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Miku",
      "text": "That sounded wise. I don't like how quickly that sounded wise.",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Zhou Shen",
      "text": "Legends are just people who kept walking after others stopped.",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Miku",
      "text": "Easy for you to say. Your voice sounds like it was handcrafted by the moon.",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Zhou Shen",
      "text": "And yours sounds like someone still learning what she wants to say with her life.",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Miku",
      "text": "...Is that good or bad?",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Zhou Shen",
      "text": "It means you are alive in your dream, not merely decorating it.",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Miku",
      "text": "Okay. Even if I'm scared, I'm not turning back now.",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Zhou Shen",
      "text": "Come, then. Get on stage, and sing until your last breath.",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false,
      "battleKey": "zhoushen_boss_demo"
    }
  ]
}
